{"unit_id": "tag:0B5I:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是次数（degree）为<MATH_0002>的齐次（homogeneous）元素。回顾一下，<MATH_0003>对应于<MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005>，见引理<REF_0001>。于是可以定义一个典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0006>\n这个定义有意义，因为<MATH_0007>是可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0008>的一个平凡化截面（trivializing section），见引理<REF_0002>及其证明。由于<MATH_0009>是准凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，这就给出一个典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0010>\n这里用到了《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0003>。要得到一个全局（global）映射（map），只需证明上述映射（maps）在交叠处（overlaps）能够粘合（glue）。略去这一点的证明。最后一个陈述的证明也略去。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "trivializing section", "target_term": "平凡化截面"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "global", "target_term": "全局"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠处"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "表示齐次元素的次数。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "描述具有指定次数的元素。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指引理中与给定对象对应的模。"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "指利用截面定义的映射。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "描述由该截面平凡化的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指具有该平凡化截面的对象。"}, {"source_term": "trivializing section", "target_term": "平凡化截面", "context": "指使这个可逆层平凡化的截面。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "描述应用所引引理的对象。"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "指借助《概形》一章的引理得到的映射。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所引用引理所在的章节。"}, {"source_term": "global", "target_term": "全局", "context": "描述局部映射粘合所得的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指粘合后得到的全局映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指须在交叠处粘合的各个映射。"}, {"source_term": "overlaps", "target_term": "交叠处", "context": "指检验局部映射粘合的交叠区域。"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "指局部映射在交叠处相容并拼合。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01MX:title", "translation": "Proj 的函子性（Functoriality）", "allowed_english": ["Proj"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Functoriality", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "指本节所讨论的 Proj 构造的函子性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01MX:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n分次环（graded ring）的映射（map）<MATH_0001>并不总能给出相应的射影（projective）齐次谱（homogeneous spectra）之间的态射（morphism）。这是因为逆（inverse）像（image）<MATH_0002>（对齐次素理想（homogeneous prime）<MATH_0003>所取）可能包含无关素理想（irrelevant prime）<MATH_0004>，即使<MATH_0005>不包含<MATH_0006>也是如此。正确的结果陈述如下。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous prime", "target_term": "齐次素理想"}, {"source_term": "irrelevant prime", "target_term": "无关素理想"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指给定映射所涉及的环。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指给定的分次环映射。"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰与分次环相应的齐次谱。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "指两个分次环各自相应的谱。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指相应的射影齐次谱之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与 image 构成 inverse image，按术语库存分别标注。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "与 inverse 构成 inverse image，按术语库存分别标注。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous prime", "target_term": "齐次素理想", "context": "指沿给定映射取逆像的素理想。"}, {"source_term": "irrelevant prime", "target_term": "无关素理想", "context": "指可能包含在所取逆像中的素理想。"}], "notes": []}
